<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Shipyard 9-mth net 41.163 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Cebu Shipyard 9-mth net 41.163 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    41.163     vs     33.697</p>
<p>    Revenue		265.871     vs    241.497</p>
<p>    Operating Profit    44.367     vs     43.973</p>
<p>Share of results</p>
<p>    from associates	4.371     vs	3.828</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	 54.767     vs     50.513</p>
<p>    Taxation		13.604     vs     16.816</p>
<p>NOTE: Cebu Shipyard and Engineering Works Inc is a unit of Keppel Philippines Holdings Inc, the local flagship of Singapore's Keppel Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
